  "limits": [
    "This read predates maintenance and is not a writer fence.",
    "Equal latest hash/when means no later entry in the inspected old image journal; it does not promise zero SQL or bootstrap DDL when drizzle-kit migrate is rerun.",
    "No migrator/app is imported. Only builtin filesystem/crypto and the installed postgres driver are loaded.",
    "Database name is compared in RAM with the connection URL. Neither the name, URL, credentials nor a hash of credentials is persisted.",
    "No claim is made about OCI argv, a future Railway redeploy implementation or its decision to execute preDeploy."
  ]
